Services | Tata 1mg",description:"Book adult vaccinations at home with Tata 1mg. Get Flu, HPV, Shingles, Pneumococcal, Tdap and other vaccines with doctor guidance, cold-chain delivery, and trained healthcare professionals.",schemaData:{organization:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization",name:"Tata 1mg",url:"https://www.1mg.com/",logo:"https://www.1mg.com/images/tata_1mg_logo.svg",sameAs:["https://www.facebook.com/1mgOfficial","https://twitter.com/1mgofficial","https://www.instagram.com/1mgofficial","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ1IqsB9G0MZJp5HhE3G0YQ","https://www.linkedin.com/company/1mg"],contactPoint:{"@type":"ContactPoint",telephone:"+91-0124-4166666",contactType:"Customer Support",areaServed:"IN",availableLanguage:["English","Hindi"]},address:{"@type":"PostalAddress",streetAddress:"5th Floor Tower - B of the Presidency Building, 46/4 Mehrauli Gurgaon Road",addressLocality:"Gurugram",addressRegion:"Haryana",postalCode:"122016",addressCountry:"IN"},founder:[{"@type":"Person",name:"Prashant Tandon"},{"@type":"Person",name:"Gaurav Agarwal"}],foundingDate:"2015",description:"Tata 1mg is India's leading digital healthcare platform offering online pharmacy services, diagnostics, e-consultations, and health content.",brand:{"@type":"Brand",name:"Tata 1mg"}},service:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#service",name:"Adult Vaccination at Home",description:"Book adult vaccination services at home with Tata 1mg. Choose from a range of vaccines administered by trained healthcare professionals.",provider:{"@id":"https://www.1mg.com/#organization"},serviceType:"Adult Vaccination",category:"Vaccination Service",areaServed:{"@type":"Country",name:"India"},availableChannel:{"@type":"ServiceChannel",serviceUrl:"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination"},hasOfferCatalog:{"@type":"OfferCatalog",name:"Adult Vaccination Services",itemListElement:[{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"Influenza Vaccine"}},{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"Shingles Vaccine"}},{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"HPV Vaccine"}},{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"Pneumococcal Vaccine"}},{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"Typhoid Vaccine"}},{"@type":"Offer",itemOffered:{"@type":"MedicalTherapy",name:"Tdap Vaccine"}}]}},medicalWebPage:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"MedicalWebPage","@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#webpage",url:"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination",name:"Adult Vaccination at Home | Tata 1mg",description:"Book adult vaccination services at home with Tata 1mg. Get vaccinated safely by trained healthcare professionals.",isPartOf:{"@type":"WebSite",name:"Tata 1mg",url:"https://www.1mg.com/"},about:{"@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#service"},publisher:{"@id":"https://www.1mg.com/#organization"},breadcrumb:{"@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#breadcrumb"},primaryImageOfPage:{"@type":"ImageObject",url:"https://onemg.gumlet.io/staging/37a8b24d-714f-4819-9a26-f2f177aa48a3.png"}},breadcrumbList:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#breadcrumb",itemListElement:[{"@type":"ListItem",position:1,name:"Home",item:"https://www.1mg.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem",position:2,name:"Adult Vaccination",item:"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination"}]},faqPage:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.1mg.com/leadgen/adult-vaccination#faq",mainEntity:[{"@type":"Question",name:"Why do I need vaccines as an adult?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"As you age, your immune system weakens. Vaccines help protect against severe illnesses, reduce complications, and prevent the spread of diseases, especially to those with weakened immune systems."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Which vaccines should I get as an adult?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"The vaccines you may need depend on your age, health status, occupation, lifestyle, and travel plans. Common vaccines for adults include: Flu vaccine, Td/Tdap (tetanus, diphtheria, pertussis), Shingles vaccine, Pneumococcal vaccine, HPV vaccine, Hepatitis vaccines."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Do I need a vaccine if I was vaccinated as a child?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"Yes, some childhood vaccines require boosters in adulthood to maintain immunity, such as the Tdap booster. Your doctor can check your immunization history to determine which vaccines you might need."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Are vaccines safe for adults?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"Yes, vaccines are generally safe for adults. Side effects are usually mild, like soreness at the injection site or a low-grade fever. Serious side effects are rare. Talk to your healthcare provider if you have any concerns."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Can I get vaccinated if I have a chronic illness?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"In most cases, yes. People with chronic conditions like diabetes, heart disease, or asthma can safely receive most vaccines."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Can I get vaccinated while taking medication?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"Yes, you can typically get vaccinated while taking most medications. However, if you're taking antibiotics for an active infection, it's best to wait until you're feeling better. If you're on immunosuppressive drugs or specific treatments, it's important to consult your healthcare provider to ensure the vaccine is safe for you."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Can I get vaccinated if I'm pregnant?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"Certain vaccines are recommended during pregnancy, like the flu vaccine and Tdap. However, some vaccines should be avoided during pregnancy. Always consult your healthcare provider before getting vaccinated during pregnancy."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"Can I get a vaccine if I have a cold or mild illness?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"It's generally safe to get vaccinated if you have a mild illness like a cold. However, if you're feeling quite unwell or have a fever, it's better to wait until you're feeling better before getting vaccinated."}},{"@type":"Question",name:"I am on my period, can I get the vaccine?",acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:"Yes, you can get vaccinated while on your period. There is no concrete evidence to suggest that menstruation affects the safety or effectiveness of vaccines."}}]}}},default:{title:"TATA 1mg - India's Leading Healthcare Platform",description:"TATA 1mg provides online medicine orders, doctor consultations, and lab test bookings."}},f={ERROR_IMAGE_PATH:"illustrations/not-available.svg",ERROR_SCREEN_HEADER:"Something went wrong",ERROR_SCREEN_DESCRIPTION:"We're having trouble loading this page. Please try again.",ERROR_SCREEN_IMAGE_ALT_TEXT:"Error",ERROR_SCREEN_CTA_LABEL:"Retry",CHEVRON_UP:"svgs/icons/chevron-up_18px_primary.svg"},Se=["/tnc","/privacypolicy","/return-policy","/ip-policy","/grievance-redressal-policy","/fakejobsandfrauddisclaimer","/healthcheckup","Tnc/referral","/sample-letter","/brandlaunch","/diabetes","/pollution","/bp-monitor-guide","/labs-10-on-10","/corporategovernance","/customersafety","/policyforpap","/consult-plan","/zyduswellness","/share-and-earn","/information/nppa-circulars"],Ce=["/world-cancer-day","/adpartners","/sale/best-seller-packages","/information/radiology","/awareness/sexual-reproductive-health"],_e=["/freestylelibre","/jubilant","/bigbrandsale","/ozempic-injection","/sale/healthy-gut-days","/sale/supp-wellness","/sale/healthy-india-lab-test-combos","/sale/summer-skin-care-fest","/sale/womenwellness","/information/ayurpersona-assessments"],Ie="StaticPage-module__btnBackToTop___-lPVG",Oe="StaticPage-module__htmlNodeWrapper___V2yOa",M={btnBackToTop:Ie,htmlNodeWrapper:Oe},ke=q(f.ERROR_IMAGE_PATH